-    <h2>Three states of a power — the path codex<span class="lead">The drawer shows only what you can do now. The codex shows the whole shape of your becoming.</span></h2>
-    <p>Because the drawer hides what you cannot yet attempt, it answers "what now?" cleanly — but it cannot answer "what could I still become?" That question lives in the <span class="term">codex</span>, a browsable catalog of every divine act. Open it from your character sheet (or the Signatures readout on your dashboard), and each card wears one of three plain marks for <em>this</em> incarnation:</p>
-    <div class="ortho">
-      <div class="ortho-card">
-        <h4>Yours</h4>
