-      </div>
-    </div>
-    <p>The codex is deliberately kept <span class="term">out of the drawer</span>: your turn-to-turn hand stays clean, holding only what you can actually play, while the fuller map of your identity — held, earnable, and forever-elsewhere — waits one click away. From the dashboard, "what you could still become" opens the codex already filtered to <em>within reach</em> — the shortest read of your run's remaining arc.</p>
